      <guid>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/conferences/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Below you may find some of the conferences I have attended over the years.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;AsiaCCS&#39;26 (01-05 June 2026, Bengaluru, India)&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;asiaccs26-01-05-june-2026-bengaluru-india&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#asiaccs26-01-05-june-2026-bengaluru-india&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I attended AsiaCCS&#39;26, the 17th ACM Asia Conference on Computer and Communications Security, held on 01-05 June 2026 in Bengaluru, India, where I had been a volunteer. Few snaps added from our group dinner at Shiro, Bengaluru.&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;AsiaCCS&amp;#39;26 Photo-1&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;3072&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;4080&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/conferences/asiaccs-26-1_hu_3adb939bf89f4ac4.jpg&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/conferences/asiaccs-26-1_hu_3adb939bf89f4ac4.jpg 800w, http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/conferences/asiaccs-26-1_hu_52be3ffbc6a14afb.jpg 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/conferences/asiaccs-26-1.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;AsiaCCS&amp;#39;26 Photo-2&#34;&#xA;    