    <item>
      <title>Misc</title>
      <link>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/misc/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 14:40:59 +0530</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/misc/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;AI Day 2026 @ IITGn&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;ai-day-2026--iitgn&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#ai-day-2026--iitgn&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I attended the AI Day 2026 at IIT Gandhinagar on 12th February 2026, where I had presented a poster for our work &amp;ldquo;Davids vs. Goliath &amp;mdash; Achieving GPU-like performance using Network of Stations&amp;rdquo;. It was a great experience to interact with the attendees and share our work on achieving GPU-like performance using a network of stations. Below are some photos from the event.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
