      <title>Teaching</title>
      <link>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/teaching/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2025 14:40:59 +0530</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/teaching/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Below you may find some of the teaching activities I have been involved in over the years (as of now, only one).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Code Profiling and Optimization (November 2024)&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;code-profiling-and-optimization-november-2024&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#code-profiling-and-optimization-november-2024&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This was a Student-Run Short Course on Code Profiling and Optimization conducted at IIT Gandhinagar during my final-year of M.Tech. I was principal instructor for the course along with my batchmate Pratyush Choudhary, who was the co-instructor.&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;Code Profiling and Optimization&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;4080&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;3072&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/teaching/code-profiling-and-optimization_hu_40413b3206d28704.jpg&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/teaching/code-profiling-and-optimization_hu_40413b3206d28704.jpg 800w, http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/teaching/code-profiling-and-optimization_hu_856186e9fe64c4c1.jpg 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:61763/people/subhrajit/gallery/teaching/code-profiling-and-optimization.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
